# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  EMAIL NOTIFICATIONS (Nodemailer)  —  fill these 3 lines to turn email ON
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  When a patient books, an email is sent to CLINIC_EMAIL automatically.
#
#  EASIEST WAY — Gmail:
#   1) Use a Gmail account for the clinic.
#   2) Google Account → Security → turn ON 2-Step Verification.
#   3) Google Account → Security → App passwords → create one for "Mail".
#      You get a 16-letter password like: abcd efgh ijkl mnop
#   4) Put the Gmail address in EMAIL_USER *and* CLINIC_EMAIL below,
#      and paste that 16-letter app password (no spaces) in EMAIL_PASS.
#
#  ⚠  Use the App Password here, NOT your normal Gmail password.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
EMAIL_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
EMAIL_PORT=587
EMAIL_USER=zaidihomoeoclinic@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASS=ojniuqubllavnxpj
# Where booking notifications are delivered (usually the same clinic inbox):
CLINIC_EMAIL=zaidihomoeoclinic@gmail.com

# ── Frontend origin allowed to call this API (Vite dev server by default) ──
CLIENT_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
